um</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Career Scope After BAMS</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Government Ayurvedic Medical Officer (AYUSH)</li>\r\n<li>✅ Private practice / wellness center entrepreneur</li>\r\n<li>✅ PG studies (MD/MS) at <strong>top universities in India</strong></li>\r\n<li>✅ Herbal / Ayurvedic pharma research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Admission Process 2026</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Qualify NEET 2026</li>\r\n<li>Apply via KEA or management quota</li>\r\n<li>Document verification and eligibility confirmation</li>\r\n<li>Fee payment and seat confirmation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>👉 <a href="https://sushruthaayurveda.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Official Sushrutha Ayurvedic Medical College Website</a></p>\r\n<p>👉 <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/bams-colleges-in-bangalore/" rel="internal">Explore Top BAMS Colleges in Bangalore</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>📧 <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> | 📞 <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/Sushrutha-Campus-scaled-1.jpg',NULL,1775904580524,1775910655155,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg8i000rp0itdp38owwe','Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore Direct Admission 2026 | BAMS Fees &amp; NEET Cutoff','hillside-ayurvedic-medical-college-bangalore-direct-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('<title>Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore Direct Admission 2026 | BAMS Fees &amp; NEET Cutoff</title>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;color:#333;line-height:1.6">\r\n\r\n<h1 style="color:#1565c0">Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore BAMS Admission 2026</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore Direct Admission 2026</strong> offers students an excellent opportunity to pursue a career in traditional Indian medicine while gaining exposure to modern healthcare practices. Established in 2005 under the Bheemachandra Education Trust, this prestigious institution is affiliated with the <strong>Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</strong>, Bangalore, and is approved by the <strong>National Commission for Indian System of Medicine (NCISM)</strong>, Government of India. The college has earned its place among the <strong>top private Ayurveda colleges in Karnataka</strong>, especially for students seeking <strong>BAMS admission in Bangalore</strong> under management or NRI quota.\r\n\r\nThe college offers a comprehensive <strong>Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery (BAMS)</strong> program, which spans 5.5 years, including one year of compulsory rotatory internship. The curriculum is designed to impart in-depth knowledge of classical Ayurvedic principles along with basic modern medical science to help students meet the healthcare needs of today’s society. Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College is committed to producing competent Ayurveda doctors who are well-versed in both traditional healing and scientific advancements.\r\n\r\nHillside stands out as one of the best options for <strong>BAMS direct admission in Bangalore 2026</strong> thanks to its experienced faculty, well-equipped laboratories, and on-campus Ayurvedic hospital that provides ample clinical exposure. Students actively participate in patient care right from their early years of study, ensuring practical learning along with theoretical excellence. The college also has tie-ups with renowned Ayurvedic pharmaceutical companies and wellness centers, enhancing the internship and placement opportunities for its graduates.\r\n\r\nThe campus is situated in a serene, green environment conducive to focused learning and holistic growth. Facilities include herbal gardens with more than 200 species of medicinal plants, modern classrooms, digital libraries, dissection halls, Panchakarma therapy units, and well-maintained hostels for both boys and girls. The Ayurvedic hospital attached to the college offers outpatient and inpatient services, Panchakarma treatments, Ksharasutra therapy, and specialized clinics, ensuring students gain hands-on experience in authentic Ayurvedic practices.\r\n\r\nAdmission for <strong>BAMS 2026 at Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College</strong> is open for eligible candidates who have completed their 10+2 or equivalent examination with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology, securing at least 50% marks (40% for reserved categories). NEET-UG qualification is mandatory as per NCISM regulations. The college offers seats under merit, management quota, and NRI quota, making it accessible for students from diverse backgrounds.\r\n\r\nFor detailed guidance on the <strong>BAMS fee structure</strong>, seat matrix, management quota admission, and hostel facilities for <strong>Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore</strong>, interested students and parents can reach out to:\r\n\r\n📧 Email: <strong>support@collegeadm.org</strong>\r\n📞 Phone: <strong>+91 7707055155</strong>\r\n\r\nSecure your future at one of the <strong>best Ayurveda colleges in Bangalore</strong> and become a part of India’s rich healing tradition combined with modern clinical excellence. Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore is your gateway to a rewarding career in holistic medicine!</p>\r\n\r\n<img src="/images/colleges/hillside-ayurvedic-college-campus.jpg" alt="Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore BAMS campus" style="width:100%;margin:10px 0">\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">📌 College Overview</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%">\r\n<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff"><th>Particular</th><th>Details</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>College Name</td><td>Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College &amp; Hospital, Bangalore</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Established</td><td>2005</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Affiliation</td><td>RGUHS Bangalore</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Approved By</td><td>NCISM, Govt. of India, Govt. of Karnataka</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Course</td><td>BAMS (Ayurvedacharya)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Direct Admission Contact</td><td>📧 <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> 📞 <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore College Direct Admission 2026 Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>✅ Over 20 years of educational excellence</li>\r\n<li>✅ NAAC-accredited parent group institutions</li>\r\n<li>✅ Herbal garden, Panchakarma unit, modern labs</li>\r\n<li>✅ Experienced faculty and hospital exposure</li>\r\n<li>✅ Hostel, transport, library, digital classrooms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">🎓 BAMS Course Details</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery (BAMS)</strong> at Hillside Ayurvedic Medical College Bangalore is a 5.5-year course that includes one year of compulsory internship. The course is taught in English and aims to produce competent Ayurveda practitioners.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style="color:#1565c0">BAMS Eligibility</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>10+2 (Physics, Chemistry, Biology) with 50% (40% SC/ST)</li>\r\n<li>NEET 2024 qualified</li>\r\n<li>Minimum age 17 years by 31st Dec 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3 style="color:#1565c0">BAMS Fee Structure (2026)</h3>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%">\r\n<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff"><th>Category</th><th>Annual Fee</th><th>Total Course Fee</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Karnataka Quota</td><td>₹1,50,000</td><td>₹7,50,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Management Quota</td><td>₹2,50,000</td><td>₹12,00,000</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">📊 NEET Cut-Off Trends</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%">\r\n<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff"><th>Year</th><th>General</th><th>SC/ST/OBC</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>2024</td><td>470+</td><td>410+</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>2023</td><td>460+</td><td>400+</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">🏫 Campus Facilities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>🌿 Herbal garden &amp; Panchakarma unit</li>\r\n<li>📚 Library with Ayurvedic manuscripts</li>\r\n<li>🏥 Ayurveda hospital (OPD &amp; IPD)</li>\r\n<li>🏠 Separate hostels for boys &amp; girls</li>\r\n<li>💻 Smart classrooms &amp; e-learning</li>\r\n<li>🚍 College buses, cafeteria, sports ground</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">📥 Admission Process 2026</h2>\r\n<p>✔ Qualify NEET 2024 <br> ✔ Apply through KEA or direct management quota <br> ✔ Submit documents, verify eligibility <br> ✔ Confirm seat &amp; pay fees</p>\r\n\r\n<p>👉 Explore <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/bams-colleges-in-bangalore/" rel="internal">other top BAMS colleges in Bangalore</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📞 Call <strong>7707055155</strong> or 📧 <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> for direct BAMS admission guidance.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/Hill-Side-Ayurvedic-college.jpg',NULL,1775904580531,1775910655162,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg8o000sp0itiu06to0k','Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore | Best BPT &amp; MPT Admission 2026 | Apply Now','dayananda-sagar-college-of-physiotherapy-bangalore','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;color: #333;line-height: 1.7">\r\n\r\n<h1 style="color: #1565c0">Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore BPT &amp; MPT Admission 2026</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore</strong> is one of the most sought-after institutions for students aspiring to build a successful career in physiotherapy. Founded in 2004 under the esteemed <strong>Dayananda Sagar Institutions (DSI)</strong> group, the college is affiliated with the <strong>Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</strong>, Bangalore, and is approved by the <strong>Indian Association of Physiotherapists (IAP)</strong>. It is also accredited with an ‘A’ grade by NAAC, highlighting its commitment to academic excellence, infrastructure, and student-centric learning.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for <strong>BPT admission in Bangalore</strong> or want to pursue advanced studies in physiotherapy through <strong>MPT colleges in Bangalore</strong>, Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy offers one of the best platforms. The college provides a 4.5-year Bachelor of Physiotherapy (BPT) program (including 6 months of compulsory internship) designed to equip students with theoretical knowledge, practical skills, and real-world clinical exposure. For postgraduates, the Master of Physiotherapy (MPT) program offers specializations in areas such as Musculoskeletal Disorders &amp; Sports, Neurological &amp; Psychosomatic Disorders, Cardiopulmonary Sciences, and Community Physiotherapy. The MPT program is typically two years in duration and is structured with a focus on research, advanced techniques, and evidence-based practice.\r\n\r\nThe college is recognized among the <strong>best BPT colleges in Bangalore</strong> because of its dedicated faculty, modern laboratories, and tie-ups with reputed hospitals for clinical training. Students benefit from 100% clinical exposure through partnerships with Dayananda Sagar Hospital and other multi-specialty hospitals across Bangalore, ensuring hands-on experience in real patient care settings.\r\n\r\nApart from academics, the college focuses on developing well-rounded professionals through seminars, workshops, inter-college conferences, and community outreach programs. The institution also emphasizes research, encouraging students and faculty to publish papers and participate in national and international physiotherapy forums.\r\n\r\nThe infrastructure of Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy includes advanced anatomy labs, biomechanics labs, electrotherapy units, exercise therapy facilities, gait training setups, and a well-stocked library with the latest journals and e-resources. The campus provides a conducive environment for learning with modern classrooms, Wi-Fi connectivity, and hostel facilities for outstation students.\r\n\r\nAdmission for <strong>BPT 2026 in Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy</strong> is open, and candidates who have completed their 10+2 or equivalent with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology are eligible to apply. For <strong>MPT admission 2026</strong>, a BPT degree with compulsory internship completion is required. Management quota and NRI quota seats are available for both BPT and MPT courses.</p>\r\n\r\n<img src="/images/colleges/dayananda-sagar-physiotherapy-campus.jpg" alt="Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore campus view" style="width:100%;margin:10px 0">\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #2e7d32">Why Choose Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore BPT &amp; MPT Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<ul style="background: #e8f5e9;padding: 10px">\r\n<li>✅ NAAC A+ grade accredited physiotherapy college</li>\r\n<li>✅ Affiliated to <a href="https://www.rguhs.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">RGUHS</a> and approved by IAP</li>\r\n<li>✅ Modern infrastructure with smart classrooms</li>\r\n<li>✅ 100% internship and clinical exposure in top hospitals</li>\r\n<li>✅ Highly qualified faculty and global collaborations</li>\r\n<li>✅ Located at prime Bangalore location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Courses Offered at Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3 style="color: #1565c0">Bachelor of Physiotherapy (BPT Admission in Bangalore)</h3>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;background: #f1f8e9">\r\n<tr style="background: #43a047;color: #fff">\r\n<th>Duration</th><th>Eligibility</th><th>Seats</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>4.5 Years (incl. 6-month internship)</td>\r\n<td>10+2 (PCB 50% / 40% SC-ST) + English</td>\r\n<td>40</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3 style="color: #1565c0">Master of Physiotherapy (MPT Colleges in Bangalore)</h3>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;background: #e3f2fd">\r\n<tr style="background: #1565c0;color: #fff">\r\n<th>Duration</th><th>Eligibility</th><th>Seats</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2 Years</td>\r\n<td>BPT + Internship</td>\r\n<td>20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Fee Structure - BPT &amp; MPT Admission 2026</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%">\r\n<tr style="background: #1565c0;color: #fff">\r\n<th>Course</th><th>Yearly Fee</th><th>Total Fees</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>BPT</td><td>₹1,70,000 avg</td><td>₹7,20,000 approx</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MPT</td><td>₹2,25,000 avg</td><td>₹4,50,000 approx</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Facilities at Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>🏥 Teaching hospital &amp; clinical labs</li>\r\n<li>📚 Digital library &amp; e-learning modules</li>\r\n<li>🏨 Separate hostels for boys &amp; girls</li>\r\n<li>🍽️ Cafeteria &amp; dining halls</li>\r\n<li>🏋️ Gym, sports complex &amp; auditorium</li>\r\n<li>🚍 In-campus ATM, transport facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Cut-Off Trends for BPT Admission in Bangalore (Dayananda Sagar College)</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%">\r\n<tr style="background: #c2185b;color: #fff">\r\n<th>Year</th><th>Cut-off % (General)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2024</td><td>60%+</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2023</td><td>58%+</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2022</td><td>55%+</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Admission Process – Dayananda Sagar College of Physiotherapy Bangalore</h2>\r\n<ol style="background: #fff8e1;padding: 10px">\r\n<li>Check eligibility (10+2 PCB for BPT / BPT + internship for MPT)</li>\r\n<li>Apply via college portal or direct contact</li>\r\n<li>Attend screening/interview</li>\r\n<li>Submit documents &amp; confirm admission</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 For guidelines visit <a href="https://www.iapindia.org" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Indian Association of Physiotherapists</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Explore <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/bpt-colleges-in-bangalore/" rel="internal">other BPT colleges in Bangalore</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📧 <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> | 📞 <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/Dayananda_Sagar_College_of_Physio.png',NULL,1775904580537,1775910655169,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg8u000tp0it8bgbf5ou','Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy Admission, Bangalore - Direct Admission 2026, Fees, Eligibility &amp; Ranking','vydehi-institute-of-physiotherapy-admission','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('<title>Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | Top BPT MPT College Bangalore</title>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;color: #333;line-height: 1.7">\r\n\r\n<h1 style="color:#2e7d32">Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy Admission 2026 – Best BPT &amp; MPT College in Bangalore</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy Admission 2026</strong> is your gateway to one of the <strong>top physiotherapy colleges in Bangalore</strong>. Vydehi Institute, located in Whitefield, is a premier institution offering both <strong>BPT</strong> and <strong>MPT admission in Bangalore</strong>. Recognized by the <a href="https://www.iapindia.org/" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Indian Association of Physiotherapists (IAP)</a> and affiliated to <a href="https://www.rguhs.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">RGUHS Bangalore</a>, Vydehi stands out for its academic excellence and exceptional clinical training through Vydehi Super Specialty Hospital.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color:#1565c0">📌 Table of Contents</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href="#overview">College Overview</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="#bpt">BPT Admission in Bangalore</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="#mpt">MPT Admission in Bangalore</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="#clinical">Clinical Exposure</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="#facilities">Campus Facilities</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="#contact">Contact for Admission</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 id="overview" style="color:#1565c0">🏫 Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy – College Overview</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse: collapse;width:100%;background:#e8f5e9">\r\n<tr style="background:#43a047;color:#fff">\r\n<th>Feature</th><th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>82, EPIP Area, Whitefield, Bangalore</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Established</td><td>2002</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Affiliation</td><td>Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Accreditation</td><td>NAAC ''A'' Grade</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Recognition</td><td>Indian Association of Physiotherapists (IAP)</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 id="bpt" style="color:#1565c0">🎓 BPT Admission in Bangalore 2026 – Vydehi Institute</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse: collapse;width:100%;background:#fff8e1">\r\n<tr style="background:#f9a825;color:#fff">\r\n<th>Key Information</th><th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td>Duration</td><td>4.5 Years (including 6-month internship)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Eligibility</td><td>10+2 with PCB + English (min 40%)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Age</td><td>17+ by 31 Dec 2026</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Basis</td><td>Merit + RGUHS/IAP Norms</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 id="mpt" style="color:#1565c0">🎓 MPT Admission in Bangalore 2026 – Vydehi Institute</h2>\r\n<ul style="background:#e3f2fd;padding:10px">\r\n<li>Duration: 2 years</li>\r\n<li>Eligibility: BPT with internship completed</li>\r\n<li>Specializations: Neuro, Musculoskeletal, Cardio, Community, Pediatric Physiotherapy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 id="clinical" style="color:#1565c0">🏥 Clinical Exposure at Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1000+ patient exposure daily at Vydehi Super Specialty Hospital</li>\r\n<li>Departments: ICU, Orthopedic Rehab, Women’s Health, Pediatrics, Neuro Rehab</li>\r\n<li>Part of multi-disciplinary teams with doctors, nurses, therapists</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Read more on official sites: <a href="https://www.ayush.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Ministry of AYUSH</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 id="facilities" style="color:#1565c0">🏫 Campus Facilities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hostels for boys and girls</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria, gym, library, seminar halls</li>\r\n<li>Transport, ATM, digital classrooms, sports complex</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<img src="/images/colleges/vydehi-physiotherapy-campus.jpg" alt="Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy Admission 2026 campus" style="width:100%;margin-top:10px">\r\n\r\n<h2 id="contact" style="color:#1565c0">📞 Contact for Vydehi Institute of Physiotherapy Admission 2026</h2>\r\n<p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> | Call: <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\r\n<p>Explore <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/physiotherapy-colleges-bangalore/" rel="internal">other physiotherapy colleges in Bangalore</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/vydehi-institute-of-medical-sciences-and-research-centre-whitefield-bangalore-private-hospitals-p1a0clcf3q.png',NULL,1775904580543,1775910655176,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg91000up0itzm9n7n6f','CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026 | Dayananda Sagar Medical College Bangalore Fees, Cutoff','cdsimer-mbbs-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026 | Fees, NEET Cutoff, Eligibility, Seat Intake</title>\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1 style="color: #1565c0">CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026 – Top Private Medical College in Karnataka</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026</strong> is now open for NEET-qualified students who want to pursue a career in medicine from one of the <strong>top private medical colleges in Karnataka</strong>. CDSIMER (Dr. Chandramma Dayananda Sagar Institute of Medical Education &amp; Research) is affiliated with Dayananda Sagar University and approved by the <a href="https://www.nmc.org.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">National Medical Commission (NMC)</a>. Located on a 125-acre campus near Bangalore, CDSIMER is known for its 1350+ bed teaching hospital and world-class clinical infrastructure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With state-of-the-art labs, expert faculty, and a robust academic structure, <strong>CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026</strong> is a golden opportunity for students aiming for a well-rounded and reputed medical education in India.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #2e7d32">Why Choose CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>✅ NMC-approved private medical college under Dayananda Sagar University</li>\r\n  <li>✅ 125-acre modern campus in Bangalore</li>\r\n  <li>✅ Teaching hospital with over 1350+ beds (under phases)</li>\r\n  <li>✅ Expert faculty and simulation-based learning</li>\r\n  <li>✅ Strong clinical exposure and advanced diagnostics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026: College Overview</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;background: #f9f9f9">\r\n<tr style="background: #1565c0;color: #fff">\r\n  <th>Particular</th><th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td>College Name</td><td>Dr. Chandramma Dayananda Sagar Institute of Medical Education &amp; Research (CDSIMER)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Affiliation</td><td>Dayananda Sagar University (DSU), Bangalore</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Approval</td><td>National Medical Commission (NMC)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Course Offered</td><td>MBBS</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Campus Size</td><td>125 Acres</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Hospital Beds</td><td>1350+ Beds</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Established</td><td>2019</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>Kanakapura Road, Ramanagara District, Karnataka</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026: Course Details</h2>\r\n<p>The Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) course at CDSIMER is designed to provide students with a solid foundation in medical theory and practical exposure.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 4.5 Years + 1-Year Internship</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Annual Intake:</strong> 150 MBBS Seats</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> 10+2 with PCB (50% for General, 40% for SC/ST/OBC) + NEET UG 2026 Qualified</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Age:</strong> Must be 17 years by 31st December 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Apply through <a href="https://cetonline.karnataka.gov.in/kea/" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">KEA (Karnataka Examination Authority)</a> counseling for MBBS seat allotment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">MBBS Fees at CDSIMER</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;background: #fff3e0">\r\n<tr style="background: #ff6f00;color: #fff">\r\n  <th>Category</th><th>Annual Fees (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td>Government Quota</td><td>₹1,41,196</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Management Quota</td><td>₹10,92,852</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>💡 Hostel, mess, and miscellaneous fees are additional and vary depending on accommodation type.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026: NEET Cutoff (Expected)</h2>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;background: #e8f5e9">\r\n<tr style="background: #43a047;color: #fff">\r\n  <th>Category</th><th>Expected NEET Score</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td>General</td><td>470+</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>OBC/SC/ST</td><td>400+</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Facilities at CDSIMER Bangalore</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>1350+ bed multi-specialty hospital with ICU &amp; Trauma Units</li>\r\n  <li>Central library with e-journals and study zones</li>\r\n  <li>Digital classrooms &amp; simulation labs</li>\r\n  <li>Separate hostels for boys and girls</li>\r\n  <li>24/7 ambulance, blood bank, and diagnostics</li>\r\n  <li>Sports ground, gym, cafeteria, and transport facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">About Dayananda Sagar University (DSU)</h2>\r\n<p>CDSIMER is part of Dayananda Sagar University, one of the fastest-growing private universities in India. DSU is NAAC accredited and ISO-certified, offering courses in engineering, health sciences, and business studies. With a legacy of over 60 years in education, DSU has built a reputation for excellence and innovation in higher education. <a href="https://www.dayanandasagar.edu/" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Visit DSU Official Website</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">How to Apply for CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li>Appear and qualify NEET UG 2026</li>\r\n  <li>Register on <a href="https://cetonline.karnataka.gov.in/kea/" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">KEA portal</a></li>\r\n  <li>Attend document verification &amp; counseling</li>\r\n  <li>Select CDSIMER during choice filling</li>\r\n  <li>Pay fees and confirm seat allotment</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">Need Help with CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a><br>\r\n📞 <strong>Call/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>👉 Also check out: <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/bams-colleges-in-bangalore/" rel="internal">Top BAMS Colleges in Bangalore</a> | <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/mbbs-direct-admission-in-bangalore/" rel="internal">MBBS Direct Admission in Bangalore</a></p>\r\n\r\n<img src="/images/colleges/cdsimer-campus-view.jpg" alt="CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026 campus view" style="width:100%;margin-top:20px">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/placeholder-college.jpg',NULL,1775904580550,1775910655184,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg99000vp0it8zxhy2r3','Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences MBBS Admission 2026 | Direct Seat &amp; Fee','vydehi-institute-of-medical-sciences-mbbs-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('<section style="color: #000000;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6">\r\n\r\n<h1><strong>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences MBBS Admission 2026 – Fees, Cutoff, Direct Seats</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences MBBS Admission 2026</strong> is now open for NEET qualified candidates. Located in the heart of Bangalore, Vydehi is one of the <strong>top medical colleges in Karnataka</strong>, offering a 250-seat MBBS program affiliated to RGUHS and recognized by the National Medical Commission (NMC).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In this detailed post, we’ll cover MBBS eligibility, fee structure, NEET cutoff, management/NRI quota, and the <a href="https://kea.kar.nic.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">KEA counseling</a> process for <strong>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences MBBS Admission 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<h2>🎓 Why Choose Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences for MBBS in 2026?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Recognized by NMC (formerly MCI) &amp; ISO 9001:2008 Certified</li>\r\n  <li>NAAC ‘A’ Grade Accreditation – CGPA 3.62</li>\r\n  <li>Affiliated to <strong>Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Located in Whitefield, Bangalore – a premier healthcare hub</li>\r\n  <li>1600+ bedded hospital offering real-time clinical exposure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Vydehi stands out for integrating <strong>modern medicine and Ayurveda</strong> education with advanced super-specialty training facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<h2>📚 MBBS Program Overview – Vydehi Admission 2026</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Course:</strong> Bachelor of Medicine &amp; Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Seats:</strong> 250</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 4.5 Years + 1 Year Internship</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Eligibility for Vydehi MBBS Admission 2026</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>NEET UG 2026 qualification mandatory</li>\r\n  <li>10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology &amp; English</li>\r\n  <li>Minimum 50% marks (General), 40% (SC/ST/OBC)</li>\r\n  <li>Age: 17 years on or before 31st December 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>💰 MBBS Fee Structure (Annual – 2026)</h4>\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8">\r\n<thead><tr><th>Quota</th><th>Annual Fee</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Government Quota</td><td>₹1,51,196</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Private Quota</td><td>₹12,70,406</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>NRI / Others</td><td>₹45,12,450</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>🔗 <a href="http://localhost:8080/cdsimer-mbbs-admission-2026" target="_blank">Related: CDSIMER MBBS Admission 2026 – Eligibility &amp; Fees</a></blockquote>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<h2>📝 Admission Process – Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences MBBS Admission 2026</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Admission is strictly through NEET-UG 2026. Students must register via:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href="https://kea.kar.nic.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">KEA (Karnataka Examination Authority)</a> – for state quota seats</li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://mcc.nic.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">MCC (Medical Counseling Committee)</a> – for AIQ &amp; Deemed University quota</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>🗂️ Documents Required</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>10th &amp; 12th Marksheets</li>\r\n  <li>NEET 2026 Scorecard &amp; Admit Card</li>\r\n  <li>Photo ID Proof (Aadhaar/Passport)</li>\r\n  <li>Transfer Certificate, Medical Fitness Certificate</li>\r\n  <li>Caste Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏥 Campus Facilities at Vydehi Bangalore</h2>\r\n\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8">\r\n<thead><tr><th>Facility</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Hospital</td><td>1600+ bedded super-specialty hospital</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Hostels</td><td>Separate for boys &amp; girls with mess</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Library</td><td>Digital &amp; physical resources</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Wi-Fi</td><td>Campus-wide connectivity</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Gym &amp; Sports</td><td>Indoor and outdoor sports facilities</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Ayurveda Gram</td><td>Unique Ayurvedic healing center</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<h2>📊 NEET Cutoff 2024 (Expected) – Vydehi MBBS Admission</h2>\r\n\r\n<table border="1" cellpadding="8">\r\n<thead><tr><th>Quota</th><th>NEET Rank</th><th>Score Range</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Government</td><td>Up to 12,000</td><td>585+</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Private</td><td>Up to 1,50,000</td><td>400+</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>NRI</td><td>--</td><td>NEET qualified only</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Note: Cutoff ranks may vary based on category and seat availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<h2>📞 Contact for Vydehi MBBS Admission 2026</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences, Bangalore</strong><br>\r\n📍 EPIP Area, Whitefield, Bangalore – 560066<br>\r\n📱 <strong>Call/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+917707055155">7707055155</a><br>\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a><br>\r\n🌐 <a href="http://localhost:8080" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">www.collegeadm.org</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>For guidance on MBBS admission through KEA/MCC, NRI quota, or fee updates – contact our medical admission experts today!</em></p>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/Vydehi-Institute-of-Medical-Sciences-1.webp',NULL,1775904580557,1775910655191,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg9h000wp0it8ula5zcy','JSS Medical College, Mysore – MBBS &amp; PG Admission 2026, Courses, Fees &amp; Facilities','jss-medical-college-mbbs-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026: Fees, Cutoff &amp; Seats</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026</h1>\r\n<img src="/images/jss-medical-college.jpg" alt="JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026" />\r\n<p>JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026 is now open for eligible NEET-UG qualified candidates. As one of the most reputed private medical institutions in Karnataka, JSS Medical College, Mysore, attracts thousands of medical aspirants every year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<p>Established in 1984 and affiliated to JSS Academy of Higher Education &amp; Research, JSS Medical College offers MBBS, MD, MS, and super-specialty medical courses. Recognized by the National Medical Commission (NMC) and listed by the World Directory of Medical Schools (WDOMS), it has international accreditations that add value to the degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Courses Offered at JSS Medical College</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>MBBS – 200 Seats (4.5 Years + 1-Year Internship)</li>\r\n  <li>PG Courses – MD/MS (157 Seats)</li>\r\n  <li>Super-Specialty – DM/M.Ch (Gastroenterology, Neurology, Urology)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Eligibility for MBBS Admission 2026</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Must qualify NEET-UG 2026</li>\r\n  <li>Min 50% marks in PCB (General Category)</li>\r\n  <li>Minimum age: 17 years as on 31st Dec 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>JSS Medical College MBBS Fees &amp; Seat Intake</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Annual Tuition Fees: ₹18,00,000 (approx. for NRI/Management Quota)</li>\r\n  <li>Total MBBS Seats: 200</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Admission Process</h3>\r\n<p>Admission to JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026 is conducted through MCC’s All India Deemed University Counselling based on NEET UG rank. Visit the <a href="https://mcc.nic.in" rel="dofollow" target="_blank">official MCC website</a> for updated counselling dates.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Campus Facilities</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>1800+ bedded JSS Hospital</li>\r\n  <li>Wi-Fi enabled digital campus</li>\r\n  <li>Modern hostel and canteen facilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Contact for JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026</h3>\r\n<p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> | Helpline: 7707055155</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Popular Searches</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>JSS Medical College MBBS Admission 2026</li>\r\n  <li>MBBS in Mysore Private College</li>\r\n  <li>JSS NEET UG Cutoff 2026</li>\r\n  <li>Best Deemed Medical Colleges in India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Internal Link:</strong> Check <a href="http://localhost:8080/vydehi-institute-of-medical-sciences-mbbs-admission-2026" rel="dofollow">Vydehi Medical College MBBS Admission 2026</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>External Resource:</strong> <a href="https://www.jssuni.edu.in" rel="dofollow" target="_blank">Official JSS AHER Website</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>External Resource:</strong> <a href="https://www.nmc.org.in" rel="dofollow" target="_blank">National Medical Commission</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/J.S.S.-Medical-College-8-compress.webp',NULL,1775904580565,1775910655198,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg9p000xp0it8pyclxa7','KLE JNMC MBBS Admission 2026: Fees, NEET Cutoff, Seats &amp; Process','kle-jnmc-mbbs-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>KLE JNMC MBBS Admission 2026: Fees, NEET Cutoff, Seats &amp; Process</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>KLE JNMC MBBS Admission 2026</h1>\r\n<img src="/images/kle-jnmc-mbbs-admission.jpg" alt="KLE JNMC MBBS Admission 2026" />\r\n<p><strong>KLE Jawaharlal Nehru Medical College (JNMC), Belagavi</strong> is one of the best medical colleges in India for MBBS, PG, and super-specialty programs. Established in 1963 and recognized by NMC, JNMC is a top choice for NEET-qualified students seeking quality education and clinical exposure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose KLE JNMC MBBS Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Deemed to be University under KLE Academy of Higher Education</li>\r\n  <li>Ranked among Top 20 private medical colleges in India</li>\r\n  <li>Recognized by WHO, Malaysian Medical Council, and NAAC ''A'' Grade</li>\r\n  <li>Over 3400 beds across two teaching hospitals</li>\r\n  <li>Global alumni working in USA, UK, Canada, UAE, Australia</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>MBBS Admission at KLE JNMC Belagavi – 2026</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 5.5 Years including internship</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Total Seats:</strong> 200</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Admission Process:</strong> NEET UG 2026 + MCC Deemed University Counseling</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, Biology &amp; English; Min 50% marks</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Age:</strong> 17+ years by December 31, 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>KLE JNMC MBBS Fees Structure 2026</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr><th>Quota</th><th>Annual Fee</th></tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td>General/Management</td><td>₹18,00,000 – ₹20,00,000</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>NRI Quota</td><td>₹45,00,000+</td></tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Postgraduate (MD/MS) &amp; Super-Specialty Courses</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>PG Seats:</strong> 193</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Specializations:</strong> MD in Medicine, Pediatrics, Psychiatry, Radiology; MS in General Surgery, ENT, Ortho</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Super-Specialty:</strong> DM (Cardiology, Neurology), M.Ch (Urology, Plastic Surgery)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Campus &amp; Facilities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Smart classrooms, digital libraries, Wi-Fi enabled 100-acre campus</li>\r\n  <li>Multi-specialty hospitals with NABH accreditation</li>\r\n  <li>Skill labs, e-learning modules, sports complex, AC hostels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Important Dates for KLE JNMC Admission 2026</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>NEET UG 2026 Result:</strong> June 2026</li>\r\n  <li><strong>MCC Counselling:</strong> July – September 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Contact for KLE JNMC MBBS Admission 2026</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a><br>\r\n<strong>Call:</strong> <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Useful Resources</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href="https://mcc.nic.in" rel="dofollow" target="_blank">MCC NEET UG Counselling</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://www.nmc.org.in" rel="dofollow" target="_blank">National Medical Commission</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://www.jssuni.edu.in" rel="dofollow" target="_blank">JSS Medical College Admission 2026</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/jnmc_belagavi.jpg',NULL,1775904580574,1775910655205,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qg9x000yp0itpp2w62g1','MS Ramaiah Medical College (RMC), Bangalore – NEET MBBS Admission 2026, Fees, Rankings, Hospital &amp; Campus','ms-ramaiah-medical-college-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026 - Fees, Cutoff, MBBS &amp; PG Seats</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026</h1>\r\n<img src="/images/ms-ramaiah-medical-college.jpg" alt="MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026">\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Top Private Medical College in Bangalore with NEET Admission</h3>\r\n<p>Located in the heart of Bangalore, <strong>M S Ramaiah Medical College (MSRMC)</strong> is one of the most prestigious private medical colleges in India. Established in <strong>1979</strong>, MSRMC offers <strong>MBBS, MD, MS, PG Diploma, DM &amp; M.Ch</strong> programs. The college is affiliated to <strong>RGUHS</strong> and part of <strong>Ramaiah University of Applied Sciences</strong>, with admissions managed via <strong>KEA NEET 2026 Counselling</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🎓 Medical Courses, Fees &amp; Admission Process – NEET 2026</h2>\r\n<h4>✅ College Highlights:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Name:</strong> MS Ramaiah Medical College (MSRMC)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Location:</strong> MS Ramaiah Nagar, Mathikere, Bangalore – 560054</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Established:</strong> 1979</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affiliation:</strong> RGUHS, Bangalore</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Recognized by:</strong> National Medical Commission (NMC)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Accreditation:</strong> NAAC ‘A’ Grade, ISO Certified</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Admission Through:</strong> NEET UG / NEET PG 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>📚 MS Ramaiah Medical College MBBS Admission 2026</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Duration:</strong> 4.5 Years + 1-Year Internship<br>\r\n<strong>Total Seats:</strong> 150<br>\r\n<strong>Eligibility:</strong> NEET UG 2026 qualified, 50% in PCB, 17+ years of age</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 MS Ramaiah MBBS Fee Structure 2026</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr><th>Category</th><th>NEET Cutoff</th><th>Annual Fee</th></tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Government Quota (KEA)</td><td>Karnataka Domicile</td><td>₹1,57,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Private Quota</td><td>550+</td><td>₹22,50,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>NRI Quota</td><td>450+</td><td>₹45,00,157</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>🩺 MSRMC PG MD/MS Admission 2026</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Total Seats:</strong> 114 | <strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Years<br>\r\n<strong>Eligibility:</strong> MBBS degree, Internship, NEET PG 2026 qualified</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 PG Courses &amp; Fees</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>Seats</th><th>Private Quota (₹)</th><th>NRI Quota (₹)</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>MD – General Medicine</td><td>20</td><td>45L</td><td>90L</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>MD – Dermatology</td><td>3</td><td>60L</td><td>1.2Cr</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>MD – Radiology</td><td>14</td><td>50L</td><td>1Cr</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>MS – OBG</td><td>12</td><td>45L</td><td>75L</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>🧠 Super-Specialty Admission – DM/M.Ch</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> MD/MS/DNB + NEET SS 2026<br>\r\n<strong>Courses Offered:</strong> Cardiology, Neurology, Urology, Neurosurgery, Gastroenterology, Plastic Surgery</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏥 Campus Life &amp; Facilities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>On-campus Hospital Services</li>\r\n  <li>Hostel, Library, WiFi, Canteen</li>\r\n  <li>Gym, Sports, Transport, Guest House</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>📈 MS Ramaiah Medical College Ranking</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Top 15 Private Medical Colleges in India</li>\r\n  <li>Consistently ranked 21–24 nationally</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔎 Why Choose MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Top NEET-based private medical college in Karnataka</li>\r\n  <li>Transparent counseling via KEA</li>\r\n  <li>Wide range of UG, PG, and Super-Specialty courses</li>\r\n  <li>Affordable fee structure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>📞 Contact for Direct Admission Support</h2>\r\n<p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a><br>\r\nCall: <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a><br>\r\nWebsite: <a href="http://localhost:8080/ms-ramaiah-medical-college-admission-2026" rel="dofollow">MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔗 Internal Link</h3>\r\n<p><a href="http://localhost:8080/vydehi-institute-of-medical-sciences-mbbs-admission-2026" rel="dofollow">Vydehi Medical College MBBS Admission 2026</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🌐 External Links</h3>\r\n<p><a href="https://kea.kar.nic.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">KEA Official Website</a><br>\r\n<a href="https://www.msrmc.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">MSRMC Official Website</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/ms-ramaiah-medical-college-1.jpg',NULL,1775904580581,1775910655211,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qga3000zp0ithw6mzgp7','DSCE Bangalore Admission 2026 - Courses, Fees, Direct Admission &amp; Placements','dayananda-sagar-college-of-engineering-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>DSCE Bangalore Admission 2026 - Courses, Fees, Seat Matrix, Direct Admission</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>Dayananda Sagar College of Engineering Bangalore – Admission 2026</h1>\r\n<h3>🏆 NAAC ‘A’ Grade | ISO Certified | Among Top Engineering Colleges in Karnataka</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Dayananda Sagar College of Engineering (DSCE), established in 1979, is a premier engineering college in Bangalore under Mahatma Gandhi Vidya Peetha Trust. Affiliated with <strong>Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU)</strong> and approved by <strong>AICTE, NBA, and NAAC</strong>, DSCE offers undergraduate, postgraduate, and research programs in engineering, technology, and management. DSCE is known for academic excellence, advanced infrastructure, and industry-integrated learning.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📚 Courses, Seat Intake &amp; Eligibility – DSCE Bangalore</h2>\r\n<h3>🎓 Undergraduate B.Tech Programs</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Duration</strong>: 4 Years (8 Semesters)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Eligibility</strong>: 10+2 with 45% aggregate in PCM (40% for SC/ST) + COMEDK / CET</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Admission Mode</strong>: COMEDK | KCET | Management Quota</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>💼 B.Tech Branch-wise Seat Matrix (2026)</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr><th>Branch</th><th>Seats</th></tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Computer Science &amp; Engineering (CSE)</td><td>180</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Information Science &amp; Engineering (ISE)</td><td>180</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</td><td>90</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Data Science / Cyber Security / IoT</td><td>90 Each</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering</td><td>180</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</td><td>60</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Mechanical / Civil / Aeronautical / Chemical</td><td>60 Each</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Biotechnology / Medical Electronics</td><td>60 Each</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>🎓 M.Tech, MBA &amp; MCA Programs</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>M.Tech</strong>: Structural Engineering, Highway Tech, VLSI, Computer Network Engineering</li>\r\n  <li><strong>MBA</strong>: Dual specialization – HR, Finance, Marketing, Business Analytics</li>\r\n  <li><strong>MCA</strong>: 3 Years, Eligibility – Graduation with Mathematics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>PG Eligibility</strong>: UG with 50% marks + PGCET / GATE / KMAT / MAT / CAT</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 DSCE Bangalore Fee Structure 2026</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead><tr><th>Program</th><th>Quota</th><th>Annual Fee (₹)</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>B.Tech</td><td>COMEDK</td><td>2,10,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>B.Tech</td><td>Management Quota</td><td>3L – 8L (Branch Dependent)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>M.Tech / MBA</td><td>PGCET</td><td>1L – 2.5L</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Hostel</td><td>All</td><td>95,000 – 1,20,000</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📈 DSCE Placements 2024–2026</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Total Students Placed</strong>: 1540+</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Highest Package</strong>: ₹56.5 LPA (Offered to CSE Student)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Average Package</strong>: ₹7.5 LPA</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Top Recruiters</strong>: IBM, Infosys, Accenture, Oracle, EY, JP Morgan</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Internship Offers</strong>: ₹60K/month (Top 10%)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Companies Visited</strong>: 200+ recruiters annually</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📝 Direct Admission in DSCE Bangalore 2026</h2>\r\n<p>If you missed out on a COMEDK/CET rank or want to secure a seat early, <strong>Management Quota Admission</strong> is available for B.Tech, M.Tech, MBA &amp; MCA courses. Seat allotment depends on your 12th marks and subject preference.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Popular Branches:</strong> Computer Science, AI/ML, ECE, Data Science</p>\r\n<p><strong>Seats Are Limited:</strong> Apply early for 2026 intake to avoid last-minute rush.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Contact Now:</strong> <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a> | <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>🔗 Useful Links</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href="http://localhost:8080/ms-ramaiah-medical-college-admission-2026" rel="dofollow">MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="http://localhost:8080" rel="dofollow">College Admission Website</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://comedk.org" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">COMEDK Official Site</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://www.dsce.edu.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">DSCE Official Website</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/Dayananda_Sagar_College_of_Engineering71.jpg',NULL,1775904580588,1775910655218,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qga90010p0itxqh8akbe','PES University, Bangalore – Direct Admission 2026, Courses, Fees, Ranking, Placements','pes-university-bangalore-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>PES University Bangalore Admission 2026 – Courses, Fees, Ranking, Direct Admission</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>PES University Bangalore Admission 2026</h1>\r\n\r\n<h2>🎓 Overview</h2>\r\n<p><strong>PES University (PESU)</strong>, established in 1972, is one of the top-ranked private universities in Karnataka, recognized for excellence in education, research, innovation, and placements. Located in Banashankari, Bangalore, PESU is NAAC ''A'' grade accredited and ISO 9001:2008 certified. It is approved by AICTE, UGC, NBA, and recognized for its high-quality technical, management, and design programs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Location</h3>\r\n<p>100 Feet Ring Road, Banashankari III Stage, Bangalore – 560085</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏛️ Campus Details</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Campus Area: 25 Acres (Urban)</li>\r\n  <li>University Type: Private, Co-Educational</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>🏅 Rankings 2026</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Karnataka State Ranking: #5</li>\r\n  <li>All India Ranking – Outlook: #33</li>\r\n  <li>All India Ranking – Dataquest: #30</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📚 Courses Offered &amp; Intake</h2>\r\n<h3>B.Tech Programs</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead><tr><th>Specialization</th><th>Intake</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Computer Science Engineering</td><td>480</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Electronics &amp; Communication</td><td>360</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Mechanical Engineering</td><td>240</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Electrical &amp; Electronics</td><td>120</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Biotechnology</td><td>60</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Civil Engineering</td><td>60</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>B.Arch (Architecture)</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Duration: 5 Years</li>\r\n  <li>Eligibility: 50% in 12th with Mathematics</li>\r\n  <li>Entrance: NATA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>M.Tech Programs</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead><tr><th>Specialization</th><th>Intake</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>CSE / Cloud / Cyber Security</td><td>48</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>VLSI / Signal Processing</td><td>84</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Machine Design / Thermo Fluids</td><td>48</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Power Electronics / Embedded</td><td>48</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Biotechnology / Civil Engg.</td><td>24</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>MBA</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Duration: 2 Years</li>\r\n  <li>Intake: 240</li>\r\n  <li>Exams: PESSAT, CAT, MAT, CMAT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>MCA</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Duration: 3 Years</li>\r\n  <li>Intake: 60</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Law – BBA LLB</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Duration: 5 Years</li>\r\n  <li>Intake: 40</li>\r\n  <li>Entrance: CLAT / PESSAT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>💸 Fee Structure (Management Quota)</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>Annual Fee (INR)</th></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr><td>Computer Science</td><td>₹11,00,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>ECE</td><td>₹8,00,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Mechanical</td><td>₹5,00,000</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Civil / EEE / BT / B.Arch</td><td>₹4,00,000</td></tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>KCET Quota Fee:</strong> ₹1,00,000 per year (Karnataka students)</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📝 Admission Process 2026</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>B.Tech/B.Arch: PESSAT / KCET / NATA</li>\r\n  <li>M.Tech / MBA / MCA: PESSAT / PGCET / CAT / MAT</li>\r\n  <li>Law: CLAT / PESSAT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Application Mode:</strong> Online via PESU portal</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📅 Important Dates</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Round 1 Counseling: Feb–Mar 2026</li>\r\n  <li>Round 3: June 2026</li>\r\n  <li>Final Round: July 2026</li>\r\n  <li>Academic Year Begins: August 2026</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>💼 Placement Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Highest Package: ₹34 LPA</li>\r\n  <li>Average Package: ₹6.5 LPA</li>\r\n  <li>Top Recruiters: Microsoft, Cisco, Infosys, Intel, Deloitte, Amazon</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>🏫 Campus Facilities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Hostels for Boys &amp; Girls</li>\r\n  <li>Smart Campus with Wi-Fi</li>\r\n  <li>Library, Labs, Auditorium</li>\r\n  <li>Sports, Gym, Cafeteria</li>\r\n  <li>Medical Center, Transport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>🚀 Highlight: PISAT Satellite Launch</h2>\r\n<p>PES University students developed and launched the nano-satellite <strong>PISAT</strong> via ISRO’s PSLV-C35 in 2016 – a hallmark of innovation and research at PESU.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>📞 Admission Helpdesk</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a><br>\r\n<strong>Phone/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>🔗 Useful Links</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href="http://localhost:8080/dayananda-sagar-college-of-engineering-admission-2026" rel="dofollow">DSCE Bangalore Admission 2026</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="http://localhost:8080/ms-ramaiah-medical-college-admission-2026" rel="dofollow">MS Ramaiah Medical College Admission 2026</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="http://localhost:8080" rel="dofollow">College Admission Website</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://www.pessat.com" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">PESSAT Official Portal</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href="https://pes.edu" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">PES University Official Website</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/pes-university.jpg',NULL,1775904580594,1775910655226,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qgag0011p0itndufygxr','MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | Trusted &amp; Affordable BPT/MPT','ms-ramaiah-medical-college-physiotherapy-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | BPT MPT Fees &amp; Placements</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style="max-width:900px;margin:auto;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px">\r\n  <h1 style="color:#004aad">MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | BPT &amp; MPT Direct Admission</h1>\r\n\r\n  <img src="/images/colleges/ms-ramaiah-physiotherapy-campus.jpg" alt="MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026" style="width:100%;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:15px">\r\n\r\n  <p><strong>MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026</strong> is a golden opportunity for students aspiring to study at one of the <a href="https://www.msrmc.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">top physiotherapy colleges in Bangalore</a>. Established in 1996, <strong>MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy</strong> is affiliated to <a href="https://www.rguhs.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</a> and recognized by the <a href="https://www.iapindia.org" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Indian Association of Physiotherapists (IAP)</a>. The college offers BPT and MPT programs with excellent clinical exposure at the adjoining MS Ramaiah Medical Teaching Hospital.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">🏫 About MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy</h2>\r\n  <p>Strategically located in the heart of Bangalore, MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy offers modern infrastructure, experienced faculty, and a vibrant campus life. The college shares its campus with the renowned MS Ramaiah Medical Teaching Hospital, providing students ample clinical exposure from day one. If you’re looking for a <strong>physiotherapy college in Bangalore with placements</strong> that offer opportunities in top hospitals, sports rehab centers, and research institutions, MS Ramaiah is the perfect destination. Over the years, its alumni have gone on to establish successful careers in India and abroad, excelling in clinical practice, research, teaching, and healthcare management.</p> <p>The college offers both undergraduate and postgraduate physiotherapy programs — <strong>Bachelor of Physiotherapy (BPT)</strong> and <strong>Master of Physiotherapy (MPT)</strong>. The BPT program is a 4.5-year course (including 6-month internship) designed to build strong foundational knowledge in anatomy, physiology, and therapeutic techniques. The MPT program offers specializations in fields such as musculoskeletal disorders, neurological conditions, cardiopulmonary rehabilitation, and sports physiotherapy. Students opting for <strong>MS Ramaiah Medical College admission</strong> into these programs benefit from integrated learning approaches, combining theory with practical sessions in state-of-the-art labs and hospital wards.</p> <p>A unique feature of MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy is its emphasis on evidence-based practice and research. The college hosts regular workshops, conferences, and CME (Continuing Medical Education) programs, enabling students to stay updated with the latest advances in the field. This focus on innovation and excellence has helped the college earn its reputation as one of the top physiotherapy colleges in Karnataka.</p> <p>As for <strong>MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy fees</strong>, the structure is competitive and transparent, with provisions for merit-based scholarships and education loans through nationalized banks. For students seeking <strong>direct BPT admission in Bangalore 2026</strong> under the management quota, guidance and assistance are provided throughout the application process to ensure a hassle-free experience. The college also facilitates internships and placements at leading hospitals and rehab centers, helping students build a strong career right after graduation.</p> <p>In summary, MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy combines tradition, excellence, and opportunity — making it a top choice for students aspiring for a bright future in physiotherapy in Bangalore and beyond.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">🎓 BPT &amp; MPT Course Details</h2>\r\n  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#e9f5ff">\r\n    <tr style="background:#004aad;color:#fff">\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Course</th>\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Duration</th>\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Eligibility</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">Bachelor of Physiotherapy (BPT)</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">4.5 Years (Incl. 6-Month Internship)</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">10+2 PCB, 40% Min, Age 17+</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">Master of Physiotherapy (MPT)</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">2 Years</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">BPT + Completed Internship</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">💰 MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy Fees 2026</h2>\r\n  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#f1f8e9">\r\n    <tr style="background:#2e7d32;color:#fff">\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Category</th>\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">BPT Fees / Year</th>\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">MPT Fees / Year</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">General</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">₹1,40,000 - ₹1,75,000</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">₹1,80,000 - ₹2,50,000</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">Management Quota</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">₹2,00,000+</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">₹2,75,000+</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">📊 MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | Cutoff &amp; Placements</h2>\r\n  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff3e0">\r\n    <tr style="background:#ef6c00;color:#fff">\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Year</th>\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Cutoff (General)</th>\r\n      <th style="padding:8px">Top Recruiters</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">2024</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">70%+ in 12th (BPT)</td>\r\n      <td style="padding:8px">Apollo, Fortis, Manipal, Sports Academies</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n  <p>MS Ramaiah has an excellent placement record, with graduates working in hospitals, sports teams, rehab centers, and academia.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">📝 How to Apply – Direct Admission 2026</h2>\r\n  <ol>\r\n    <li>Contact <a href="http://localhost:8080/contact" rel="nofollow">our counseling team</a>.</li>\r\n    <li>Submit 10+2 / BPT marksheets &amp; certificates.</li>\r\n    <li>Confirm seat by paying fee.</li>\r\n  </ol>\r\n  <p>For <strong>MS Ramaiah Medical College admission</strong> assistance, call 📞 <strong>7707055155</strong> or email 📧 <strong>support@collegeadm.org</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">🔗 Useful Links</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><a href="http://localhost:8080/physiotherapy-colleges-bangalore" rel="nofollow">Other Physiotherapy Colleges in Bangalore</a></li>\r\n    <li><a href="https://www.iapindia.org" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Indian Association of Physiotherapists (IAP)</a></li>\r\n    <li><a href="https://www.rguhs.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="dofollow">Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</a></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style="color:#0069d9">🌟 Why Choose MS Ramaiah?</h2>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>NAAC-accredited &amp; IAP-recognized program</li>\r\n    <li>Clinical exposure at MS Ramaiah hospitals</li>\r\n    <li>Focus on research &amp; innovation</li>\r\n    <li>Strong alumni network globally</li>\r\n    <li>Modern campus with hostels, labs, and sports facilities</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),'Contact for Fees',NULL,'Partner College','/images/colleges/MS-Ramaiah-Medical-College-Physiotherapy-Admission-2025.webp',NULL,1775904580601,1775910655232,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO College VALUES('cmnu7qgan0012p0itntxg33zw','Sri Devaraj Urs Academy of Higher Education and Research (SDUAHER), Kolar – Direct Admission 2026','sduaher-kolar-mbbs-admission-2025','Bangalore, Karnataka',replace(replace('\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  <title>SDUAHER Kolar MBBS Admission 2026 – Fees, Eligibility, Direct Admission</title>\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h1>SDUAHER Kolar MBBS Admission 2026</h1>\r\n\r\n<h2>📍 College Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Address:</strong> Tamaka, Kolar, Karnataka – 563101</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Established:</strong> 1986 (Deemed University status in 2007)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affiliation:</strong> Sri Devaraj Urs Academy of Higher Education and Research</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Approval:</strong> NMC Accredited</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Campus:</strong> 100 Acres</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Location Advantage:</strong> 5 km from Kolar town</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>🎓 Courses &amp; Seat Intake 2026</h2>\r\n<h3>MBBS Program</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Total Seats: 150</li>\r\n  <li>Duration: 5.5 Years</li>\r\n  <li>Eligibility: NEET UG Qualified</li>\r\n  <li>Annual Fee: ₹79.2 Lakhs (Management Quota)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>B.Sc Allied Health Sciences</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Specializations: OT Technology, Imaging, Perfusion Tech, etc.</li>\r\n  <li>Total Fee: ₹2.9 – ₹3.4 Lakhs</li>\r\n  <li>Placement: Apollo, AIMS, Jayadeva</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>PG Medical – MD/MS</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Specializations: General Surgery, OBG, Pediatrics, etc.</li>\r\n  <li>Seats: Varies</li>\r\n  <li>Eligibility: NEET PG</li>\r\n  <li>Annual Fee: ₹22 Lakhs (Management Quota)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>M.Sc Medical Programs</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Specializations: Biochemistry, Microbiology, etc.</li>\r\n  <li>Average Salary: ₹3–6 LPA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 SDUAHER Fee Structure 2026</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr><th>Program</th><th>Annual Fee</th></tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td