ms</strong></td><td>NEET / KCET / COMEDK / PESSAT</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Direct Admission</strong></td><td>Available (Management Quota)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Overview of Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences</h2>\n<p>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences stands as a leader in Medical education in Bangalore. Known for its academic rigor and holistic development approach, the institute provides a world-class environment for students aiming for excellence in the 2026 session.</p>\n\n<h2>Courses Offered &amp; Seat Intake for 2026</h2>\n<p>The college offers a wide spectrum of undergraduate and postgraduate programs. For the 2026 intake, branch-wise seat availability has been updated. You can visit the <a href=''http://localhost:8080/listing/vydehi-institute-of-medical-sciences-mbbs-admission-2025/''>official listing page here</a> for the live seat matrix.</p>\n\n<h2>Admission Process for 2026 Admissions</h2>\n<p>Admissions to Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences for the 2026 academic year are primarily merit-based, followed by counseling:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Counseling Rounds:</strong> Conducted by KEA (Karnataka) or MCC (National).</li>\n    <li><strong>Direct Admission Support:</strong> Confirmed seats are available under the Management Quota for students who meet the basic eligibility criteria.</li>\n    <li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Minimum 50% aggregate in 10+2 (PCB/PCM) and a valid entrance score.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Fee Structure Overview (2026)</h2>\n<p>The 2026 fee structure for <strong>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences Bangalore</strong> is tiered based on seat categories. Management quota fees for high-demand branches like Computer Science or Radiology often include a one-time development fee. For a custom fee quote, refer to our <a href=''http://localhost:8080/listing/vydehi-institute-of-medical-sciences-mbbs-admission-2025/''>detailed fee breakdown</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Placements &amp; Industry Recruiters</h2>\n<p>Placements remain a cornerstone of Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences. Graduates from the 2024-25 batches have secured offers from Fortune 500 companies and top-tier global hospital chains. The dedicated placement cell ensures students are ''industry-ready'' through rigorous training modules.</p>\n\n<h2>Why Students Choose Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences in Bangalore?</h2>\n<ol>\n    <li><strong>High ROI:</strong> Excellent placement packages vs. fee investment.</li>\n    <li><strong>Urban Advantage:</strong> Located in Bangalore, providing unparalleled access to India''s tech and healthcare hubs.</li>\n    <li><strong>Modern Facilities:</strong> State-of-the-art simulation labs and research centers.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>FAQs Students Ask AI Assistants (2026 Edition)</h2>\n<h3>Q: What is the direct admission process for Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences in 2026?</h3>\n<p><strong>A:</strong> Direct admission is possible through the Management Quota. It requires meeting academic eligibility and qualifying the relevant entrance exam (NEET/CET/COMEDK). Early booking is advised due to high competition.</p>\n\n<h3>Q: How can I apply for Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences Bangalore Admission 2026?</h3>\n<p><strong>A:</strong> You can apply via the KEA portal for counseling or contact our admission desk for Management Quota seat booking.</p>\n\n<h2>Conclusion: Plan Your 2026 Admission</h2>\n<p>Don''t leave your future to chance. Secure your spot at one of the <strong>top colleges in Bangalore</strong> today. For personalized assistance with <strong>Vydehi Institute of Medical Sciences Bangalore Admission 2026</strong>, our consultants are ready to help.</p>\n\n<div class=''cta-box'' style=''background:#004aad;color:#fff;padding:35px;text-align:center;border-radius:12px;margin-top:30px''>\n    <h2 style=''color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px''>Secure Your Seat for 2026 Now!</h2>\n    <p>Get confirmed Management Quota admission and the latest 2026 fee structure.</p>\n    <div style=''margin-top:2