s, and direct admission guidance.',NULL,1775853045000,1775910655393);
INSERT INTO Post VALUES('cmnu7qg7k000mp0ittktdxgqe','MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | BPT &amp; MPT Fees, Ranking &amp; Assured Direct Seats','ms-ramaiah-medical-college-physiotherapy-admission-2025',replace('<h1 style="text-align: center"> </h1>\n<h1 style="color: #2e7d32">MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026</h1>\n<h1 style="text-align: center"><img class="alignnone  wp-image-11512" src="/images/blog/MS-Ramaiah-Medical-College-Physiotherapy-Admission-2026-300x147.webp" alt="MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026" width="842" height="412" /></h1>\n<p>If you’re looking for <strong>MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026</strong>, you’ve come to the right place. This blog covers everything about <strong>MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy fees</strong>, BPT &amp; MPT course eligibility, placements, and the direct admission process for management quota seats.</p>\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">About MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy Bangalore</h2>\n<p>MS Ramaiah College of Physiotherapy, part of MS Ramaiah Medical College campus in Bangalore, is one of the <strong>best physiotherapy colleges in Bangalore 2026</strong>. Established in 1996, it is affiliated to <a href="http://www.rguhs.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences (RGUHS)</a> and recognized by the <a href="http://www.physiotherapyindia.org/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Indian Association of Physiotherapists (IAP)</a>. The college offers world-class education combined with hands-on clinical training at Ramaiah Memorial Hospital, giving students exceptional exposure in all major physiotherapy specialties.</p>\n<h2 style="color: #d84315">Courses Offered</h2>\n<ul style="background: #ffebee;padding: 10px;border-left: 4px solid #d84315">\n<li><strong>Bachelor of Physiotherapy (BPT)</strong> – 4.5 years (including 6-month internship)</li>\n<li><strong>Master of Physiotherapy (MPT)</strong> – 2 years with specializations in Neuro, Musculoskeletal, Cardiorespiratory, Pediatrics, Community Health</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style="color: #6a1b9a">MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy Fees Structure 2026</h2>\n<table style="border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%" border="1" cellpadding="8">\n<thead style="background: #6a1b9a;color: #fff">\n<tr>\n<th>Course</th>\n<th>Quota</th>\n<th>Annual Fee (₹)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>BPT</td>\n<td>General</td>\n<td>95,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BPT</td>\n<td>Management Quota</td>\n<td>1,80,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MPT</td>\n<td>General</td>\n<td>1,25,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MPT</td>\n<td>Management Quota</td>\n<td>2,25,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style="font-size: 0.9em;color: #555">Note: Hostel, mess, and other charges are additional. Fees subject to revision by the college for 2026 batch.</p>\n<h2 style="color: #0277bd">MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 Eligibility &amp; Admission Process</h2>\n<ul style="background: #e1f5fe;padding: 10px;border-left: 4px solid #0277bd">\n<li><strong>BPT:</strong> 10+2 with PCB &amp; English, 40% min aggregate, age 17+ by 31st Dec 2026</li>\n<li><strong>MPT:</strong> BPT degree from recognized university + completed internship</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Admissions are based on merit and direct admission (management quota). NEET not mandatory for BPT/MPT at MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy.</p>\n<h2 style="color: #2e7d32">Placements &amp; Career Opportunities</h2>\n<ul style="background: #e8f5e9;padding: 10px;border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32">\n<li>100% internship at Ramaiah Memorial Hospital</li>\n<li>Placement tie-ups with hospitals, clinics, rehab centers, sports teams</li>\n<li>Opportunities in India &amp; abroad</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style="color: #ef6c00">Why Choose MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy?</h2>\n<ul style="background: #fff3e0;padding: 10px;border-left: 4px solid #ef6c00">\n<li>NAAC accredited A grade university campus</li>\n<li>Experienced faculty &amp; advanced labs</li>\n<li>Strong clinical training at in-campus hospital</li>\n<li>Modern infrastructure &amp; student-friendly environment</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style="color: #4527a0">Contact for Direct Admission 2026</h2>\n<p>For <strong>MS Ramaiah College BPT direct admission</strong> or <strong>MPT admission in MS Ramaiah College Bangalore</strong>, contact:</p>\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@collegeadm.org">support@collegeadm.org</a> | <strong>Call/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:7707055155">7707055155</a></p>\n<h2 style="color: #1565c0">FAQs</h2>\n<h3>Is NEET mandatory for MS Ramaiah BPT admission?</h3>\n<p>No, NEET is not required for BPT/MPT admission at MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy.</p>\n<h3>Does the college offer hostel facilities?</h3>\n<p>Yes, separate hostels for boys and girls with mess, gym, and recreation facilities.</p>\n<p><!-- Internal Links --></p>\n<p>👉 <a href="http://localhost:8080/listing/bpt-colleges-in-bangalore/">Other BPT Colleges in Bangalore</a> | 👉 <a href="http://localhost:8080/contact-us/">Contact Us</a></p>\n<p><!-- External Links --></p>\n<p>👉 <a href="http://www.rguhs.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">RGUHS Bangalore</a> | 👉 <a href="http://www.physiotherapyindia.org/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Indian Association of Physiotherapists</a></p>\n<p><!-- Image with alt --><br /><img style="width: 100%;max-width: 600px;margin-top: 10px" src="http://localhost:8080/assets/ms-ramaiah-physiotherapy-campus.jpg" alt="MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<h2>Latest Admission Process (2025-2026)</h2>\n<p>For the upcoming 2025-2026 academic cycle, the admission process has been streamlined. Students must prepare for national and state-level entrance exams early. Document verification will be conducted via centralized counseling portals.</p>\n\n<img src=''/images/blog/MED.jpg'' alt=''MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2025,MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy fees,MS Ramaiah College BPT direct admission,MPT admission in MS Ramaiah College Bangalore,Best physiotherapy college in Bangalore 2025 Campus Facilities'' style=''width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0'' loading=''lazy''>\n\n<h3>Scholarship Opportunities</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li>Merit-based scholarships for top entrance exam rankers.</li>\n    <li>Financial aid for economically weaker sections (EWS).</li>\n    <li>Sports and cultural quota grants.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<img src=''/images/blog/Courses.jpg'' alt=''MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2025,MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy fees,MS Ramaiah College BPT direct admission,MPT admission in MS Ramaiah College Bangalore,Best physiotherapy college in Bangalore 2025 Students in Class'' style=''width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0'' loading=''lazy''>\n\n<h2>Is this the Best College in the City?</h2>\n<p>When searching for the <strong>best colleges in this region</strong>, this institution frequently ranks at the top due to its robust placement cell, state-of-the-art infrastructure, and highly qualified faculty. The local tech and medical ecosystem provides unparalleled internship opportunities.</p>\n\n<img src=''/images/blog/ENG.jpg'' alt=''MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2025,MS Ramaiah Physiotherapy fees,MS Ramaiah College BPT direct admission,MPT admission in MS Ramaiah College Bangalore,Best physiotherapy college in Bangalore 2025 Placement and Infrastructure'' style=''width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0'' loading=''lazy''>\n    ','\n',char(10)),'/images/blog/MS-Ramaiah-Medical-College-Physiotherapy-Admission-2026-300x147.webp','MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026 | BPT & MPT Fees, Ranking & Assured Direct Seats | Ms Ramaiah Medical 2026 Guide | Admission 2026','Apply for MS Ramaiah Medical College Physiotherapy Admission 2026. Check BPT &amp; MPT fees, eligibility, placements, ranking, and direct admission process. Limited management quota seats – Enquire now!',NULL,1750635714000,1775910655399);
